1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:07,000
I forgive people easily. I trust people easily. I forget the bad things they did easily.

2
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:13,660
I always believe they'll be different this time. I keep giving chances they never deserve,

3
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,460
and I see the good in people, even when they show me the worst.

4
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:22,980
And somehow, I end up being the one who gets hurt every single time.
